// Structural view of the SSAI overlay store on `sdk.advertisement` — optional-
// typed like the cards-queue snapshot above (and SsaiDebugPanel), so the demo
// degrades gracefully against a built lib that predates the SSAI API.

// ---- Live-edge extrapolation (edge-anchored timeline model) -----------------
//
// The live timeline axis hangs off the LIVE EDGE and has a fixed length (the
// manifest DVR window):
//
//   latency     = edge(t) − currentTime          (constant while playing at 1x)
//   playheadPct = 1 − latency / dvrSec
//   startMedia  = edge(t) − dvrSec               (left end, derived)
